# Pinterest Pin - Day 9
**Image:** ./pin.png

**Title:** 5 Claude Code Commands Every Beginner Should Know: Cheat Sheet

**Description:** Save this cheat sheet. These 5 commands will change how you use Claude Code. /compact frees up memory, /rewind goes back to any checkpoint, claude --resume picks up old sessions, Shift+Tab toggles plan mode, and /context checks your memory usage. Most beginners don't know these exist.

**Board:** Claude Code Tutorials

**Alt Text:** Pinterest cheat sheet showing 5 essential Claude Code commands for beginners: compact, rewind, resume, plan mode, and context check

